 "title": "More political emails",
 "hook": "Derek Willis, a journalism lecturer with an expertise in political data, has published a searchable, downloadable database of 100,000+ email messages received in recent years by an address he created for this purpose, and “which I routinely plug into forms I find on candidate and committee sites.” The database, which Willis plans to update weekly, lists each message’s timestamp, sender, subject line, and body.",
